6,🤗 HF 每日论文,huggingface,ABot-AgentOS: A General Robotic Agent OS with Lifelong Multi-modal Memory,https://huggingface.co/papers/2607.10350,2026-07-15,👍 68,ABot-AgentOS: A General Robotic Agent OS with Lifelong Multi：最近的 VLM 和 VLA 系统改进了机器人感知和动作预测，但长期具体代理仍然需要通用运行时层来进行推理、记忆、工具使用、验证和跨具体执行。我们推出 ABot-AgentOS，这是一种通用机器人代理操作系统，位于低级控制器之上，并为场景条件规划、上下文隔离技能执行、多阶段验证…,"Recent VLM and VLA systems have improved robotic perception and action prediction, yet long-horizon embodied agents still require a general runtime layer for reasoning, memory, tool use, verification, and cross-embodiment execution. We present ABot-AgentOS, a general robotic Agent Operating System that sits above low-level controllers and provides a deliberative agent layer for scene-conditioned planning, context-isolated skill execution, multi-stage verification, multi-modal memory, and edge-c…","Jiayi Tian, Shiao Liu, Yuting Xu, Jia Lu, Zihao Guan et al. (27 authors)",,,技术分享,开发者话题,是,是,中立资讯,3.9,4.0,9.0,0.2,,,,Agent,,待人工判断,暂未命中足够强的国际站产品锚点，不建议强贴产品，先作为行业观察保留。,这条暂不建议硬贴具体产品，可先保留为行业观察，再做人工二次判断。,主视觉用论文的核心图表（Figure 1 或方法框架图），标注关键创新点，适合技术受众。,技术科普 + 教程拆解,P2 观察中,Reddit（直接参与讨论） + LinkedIn（发教程文章）,「ABot-AgentOS: A General Robotic Agent O…」暂未命中明确产品关联。可先作为行业观察素材，人工判断是否适合关联腾讯云产品。推荐 Reddit（直接参与讨论） + LinkedIn（发教程文章）。,
6,🤗 HF 每日论文,huggingface,Long-Horizon-Terminal-Bench: Testing the Limits of Agents on Long-Horizon Terminal Tasks with Dense Reward-Based Grading,https://huggingface.co/papers/2607.08964,2026-07-15,👍 63,Long-Horizon-Terminal-Bench: Testing the Limits of Agents on：人工智能代理已经能够自主完成简短、明确的任务。然而，现有的终端基准测试主要关注在几分钟内完成的简单问题，并且仅根据最终结果进行评估。,"AI agents have become capable of autonomously completing short, well-specified tasks. However, existing terminal benchmarks largely focus on simple problems that finish within minutes and are evaluated only by their final outcome. This setup overlooks intermediate progress and partial solutions, yielding sparse reward signals and an incomplete picture of agent capability. We introduce Long-Horizon-Terminal-Bench, a terminal benchmark of 46 long-horizon tasks spanning nine categories, including…","Zongxia Li, Zhongzhi Li, Yucheng Shi, Ruhan Wang, Junyao Yang et al. (13 authors)",https://github.com/zli12321/LHTB,,技术分享,开发者话题,是,否,对比测评,3.6,4.0,9.0,0.0,,,,Agent,,待人工判断,暂未命中足够强的国际站产品锚点，不建议强贴产品，先作为行业观察保留。,这条暂不建议硬贴具体产品，可先保留为行业观察，再做人工二次判断。,主视觉用论文的核心图表（Figure 1 或方法框架图），标注关键创新点，适合技术受众。,技术科普 + 教程拆解 + 观点评论,P2 观察中,Reddit（直接参与讨论） + LinkedIn（发教程文章）,「Long-Horizon-Terminal-Bench: Testing th…」暂未命中明确产品关联。可先作为行业观察素材，人工判断是否适合关联腾讯云产品。推荐 Reddit（直接参与讨论） + LinkedIn（发教程文章）。,
6,🤗 HF 每日论文,huggingface,Video-Oasis: Rethinking Evaluation of Video Understanding,https://huggingface.co/papers/2603.29616,2026-07-15,👍 61,Video-Oasis: Rethinking Evaluation of Video Understanding：视频理解固有的复杂性使得很难确定Video-LLM基准性能是否源于视觉感知、语言推理或知识先验。尽管已经出现了许多评估高级推理的基准，但评估视频理解的共同标准仍然在很大程度上被忽视。,"The inherent complexity of video understanding makes it difficult to determine whether Video-LLM benchmark performance stems from visual perception, linguistic reasoning, or knowledge priors. While many benchmarks have emerged to assess high-level reasoning, shared criteria for evaluating video understanding remain largely overlooked. Instead of introducing yet another benchmark, we take a step back to re-examine the criteria for evaluating video understanding.","Geuntaek Lim, Sungjune Park, Jaeyun Lee, Inwoong Lee, Taeoh Kim et al. (8 authors)",https://github.com/sejong-rcv/Video-Oasis,,技术分享,开发者话题,是,否,对比测评,3.6,4.0,9.0,0.0,,,,LLM,,待人工判断,暂未命中足够强的国际站产品锚点，不建议强贴产品，先作为行业观察保留。,这条暂不建议硬贴具体产品，可先保留为行业观察，再做人工二次判断。,主视觉用论文的核心图表（Figure 1 或方法框架图），标注关键创新点，适合技术受众。,技术科普 + 教程拆解 + 观点评论,P2 观察中,Reddit（直接参与讨论） + LinkedIn（发教程文章）,「Video-Oasis: Rethinking Evaluation of V…」暂未命中明确产品关联。可先作为行业观察素材，人工判断是否适合关联腾讯云产品。推荐 Reddit（直接参与讨论） + LinkedIn（发教程文章）。,
6,🤗 HF 每日论文,huggingface,Video Generation Models are General-Purpose Vision Learners,https://huggingface.co/papers/2607.09024,2026-07-15,👍 56,Video Generation Models are General-Purpose Vision Learners：在下一个标记预测的推动下，NLP 从特定于任务的模型转变为强大的通用基础模型。那么，实现计算机视觉通用模型所需的等效催化剂是什么？,"Driven by next-token prediction, NLP shifted from task-specific models into powerful generalist foundation models. What, then, is the equivalent catalyst needed to achieve a general-purpose model in computer vision? In this paper, we contend that large-scale text-to-video generation serves as a strong pre-training paradigm for computer vision, providing the necessary spatiotemporal priors, vision-language alignment, and scalability required for general visual intelligence.","Letian Wang, Chuhan Zhang, Rishabh Kabra, Jasper Uijlings, Steven Waslander et al. (12 authors)",,,观点评论,行业观察,是,否,中立资讯,3.6,4.0,9.0,0.0,,,,,,待人工判断,暂未命中足够强的国际站产品锚点，不建议强贴产品，先作为行业观察保留。,这条暂不建议硬贴具体产品，可先保留为行业观察，再做人工二次判断。,主视觉用论文的核心图表（Figure 1 或方法框架图），标注关键创新点，适合技术受众。,观点评论,P2 观察中,LinkedIn（行业观察文章） + X（摘要快讯分享）,「Video Generation Models are General-Pur…」暂未命中明确产品关联。可先作为行业观察素材，人工判断是否适合关联腾讯云产品。推荐 LinkedIn（行业观察文章） + X（摘要快讯分享）。,
6,🤗 HF 每日论文,huggingface,Weak-to-Strong Generalization via Direct On-Policy Distillation,https://huggingface.co/papers/2607.05394,2026-07-15,👍 100,Weak-to-Strong Generalization via Direct On-Policy Distillat：具有可验证奖励的强化学习 (RLVR) 是改进语言模型推理的有效方法，但在每个新的强模型上重复的成本很高，因为目标模型必须在训练期间生成许多 rollout。随着模型规模的扩大，训练后本身就成为了瓶颈。,"Reinforcement learning with verifiable rewards (RLVR) is a powerful recipe for improving language-model reasoning, but it is expensive to repeat on every new strong model because the target model must generate many rollouts during training. As models scale, post-training itself becomes a bottleneck. We study a weak-to-strong alternative: run RL on a smaller model where rollouts are cheaper, then reuse what that RL run learned to improve a stronger target model.","Shiyuan Feng, Huan-ang Gao, Haohan Chi, Hanlin Wu, Zhilong Zhang et al. (10 authors)",,,学术研究,研究前沿,是,否,中立资讯,3.5,5.0,9.0,0.0,,,,,,待人工判断,暂未命中足够强的国际站产品锚点，不建议强贴产品，先作为行业观察保留。,这条暂不建议硬贴具体产品，可先保留为行业观察，再做人工二次判断。,主视觉用论文的核心图表（Figure 1 或方法框架图），标注关键创新点，适合技术受众。,研究解读,P2 观察中,LinkedIn（发观点总结文章） + X（论文快讯分享）,「Weak-to-Strong Generalization via Direc…」暂未命中明确产品关联。可先作为行业观察素材，人工判断是否适合关联腾讯云产品。推荐 LinkedIn（发观点总结文章） + X（论文快讯分享）。,
6,🤗 HF 每日论文,huggingface,ABot-N1: Toward a General Visual Language Navigation Foundation Model,https://huggingface.co/papers/2607.10383,2026-07-15,👍 82,ABot-N1: Toward a General Visual Language Navigation Foundat：视觉语言导航基础模型旨在将基于空间决策的深度推理与针对不同具体任务的广泛多功能性统一起来。当前的方法通常通过将观察结果直接映射到操作的整体策略来实现这种集成，但它们经常遭受坐标漂移和长尾语义处理不当的问题。,"Visual Language Navigation foundation models aim to unify deep reasoning for grounded spatial decisions with broad versatility for diverse embodied tasks. Current approaches typically achieve this integration via monolithic policies that map observations directly to actions, yet they often suffer from coordinate drift and poor handling of long-tail semantics. Furthermore, these black-box mappings lack interpretability, hindering the simultaneous achievement of generality, robustness, and transp…","Ruiyan Gong, Yingnan Guo, Junjun Hu, Jintao Kong, Xiaoxu Leng et al. (40 authors)",,,其他,行业观察,是,否,中立资讯,3.4,4.0,9.0,0.0,,,,,,待人工判断,暂未命中足够强的国际站产品锚点，不建议强贴产品，先作为行业观察保留。,这条暂不建议硬贴具体产品，可先保留为行业观察，再做人工二次判断。,主视觉用论文的核心图表（Figure 1 或方法框架图），标注关键创新点，适合技术受众。,信息快讯,P2 观察中,LinkedIn（行业观察文章） + X（摘要快讯分享）,「ABot-N1: Toward a General Visual Langua…」暂未命中明确产品关联。可先作为行业观察素材，人工判断是否适合关联腾讯云产品。推荐 LinkedIn（行业观察文章） + X（摘要快讯分享）。,
